{"lesson_uid":"L0068","_provenance":{"generator":"backend/scripts/generate_lesson_zhuyin.py","reading_authority":"frontend/src/components/zhuyin/polyphonicProcessor.ts（跑，非移植）","source_font":"frontend/public/fonts/BpmfZihiSerif-Regular.ttf","font_sha256_16":"fc25a90d27699ec4","poyin_db_sha256_16":"882bc0ae69aeef35","notation":"pypinyin BopomofoConverter（與 font_readings.json 同一個轉換器）","stats":{"texts":212,"chars":7215,"poly_positions":1800,"he_adjudicated":1,"manual_corrections":0}},"texts":[{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"yehu3","idx":1,"text":"臺灣有個只有國中學歷的植物獵人，名叫洪信介，大家都稱他為阿介。他是臺灣山林界的傳奇，也是許多博士、教授倚重的合作夥伴。","n":59,"ssz":"...1......................................................."},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"yehu3","idx":2,"text":"但你知道嗎？阿介從小過動，不擅長與人相處，在課堂上總是坐不住，成績更是慘不忍睹，學習路上挫折不斷。長大後，他的工作也一直不穩定，四十四歲以前，只能靠打零工維生。所幸，他一直熱愛植物，也在大自然中找到了屬於自己的祕密花園。雖然在學校時課業不好，他卻沒有停止學習植物知識。植物圖鑑是他的精神糧食，遇到不懂的地方，他就請教專家，不斷汲取新知。日積月累，連拗口的植物學名也難不倒他。對植物的熱愛，讓他找到適合自己的學習方式，也奠定了日後成為植物獵人的基礎。","n":224,"ssz":".............1....1.........1.................1..1........2.........................2............................................................................1.........1..1........1........................................"},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"yehu3","idx":3,"text":"為什麼需要植物獵人呢？氣候變遷與人為開發不斷破壞棲地，使許多物種悄然從地球上消失。為了維持生態多樣性，科學家必須跟時間賽跑，趕在這些物種滅絕前，將它們保存下來，讓後世的科學家研究與復育。","n":93,"ssz":"1...................1....................1..................................................."},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"yehu3","idx":4,"text":"但是，要在原始森林裡採集植物並不容易。森林裡的植物分布位置有高有低，有些接近地面，有些位在高大的樹木上。位置越高，採集就越困難，樹冠層的植物尤其難以取得。採集者不只要會爬山、爬樹，還要能在無水無電、杳無人煙的森林裡求生；同時，也得辨識物種，判斷哪些植物稀有或具有研究價值。能爬山、爬樹、在野外求生的人其實不少，熟悉植物的人也有，但能同時具備山林能力與植物專業的人少之又少，阿介正是其中的佼佼者。他走在樹上就像走在平地一樣自然，又有專業的植物知識，能和科學家溝通。多年累積的山林經驗與植物知識，使他成為許多植物專家心目中的不二人選。","n":265,"ssz":"..................................................................................................................1.............................................................................................1...............1........1..........................1...."},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"yehu3","idx":5,"text":"2008年，辜嚴倬雲植物保種中心成立，需要植物獵人進行野外採集，以保存逐漸從野外消失，甚至瀕臨滅絕的物種。阿介很想進入保種中心，讓自己多年累積的山林經驗和植物專長，真正用在植物保育上。","n":92,"ssz":".....................................................................1......1..............."},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"yehu3","idx":6,"text":"然而，保種中心卻因為他只有國中學歷，多次拒絕他。","n":24,"ssz":".........1.............."},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"yehu3","idx":7,"text":"阿介沒有就此放棄。為了跨過學歷這道門檻，中年的他決定重返校園，考上員林農工園藝科。這一次，他成為全班最認真的學生。對自己喜歡、擅長的事，他有一種「要做就做到最好」的執著。最後，他終於以學生身分進入保種中心，讓多年累積的能力有了發揮的機會。","n":119,"ssz":".........1................1...........................................2............4...........1..........1............"},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"yehu3","idx":8,"text":"進入保種中心後，他面對的困難並沒有結束。阿介每年將近三分之一的時間待在森林裡。為了採集稀有植物，他常帶著一把鐮刀，揹著四十公斤重的背包，獨自徒步進入山林十幾天。他要沿途砍路、辨認與採集植物、進行現場測量，並完整記錄數據。在茂密的山林中，他還必須快速掃視四周，認出稀有且瀕危的植物。","n":140,"ssz":".......................................1............2............1..................................1......................................."},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"yehu3","idx":9,"text":"有人說，阿介從事的是全臺灣最危險的工作。為了採集植物，即使面對近乎垂直的峭壁，他也要冒著生命危險，想盡辦法爬上去。他曾一腳踩在枯枝上，從二十公尺高的樹上摔下；也曾在山林裡迷路，「在山上哭了三天」，才僥倖存活。他曾經兩天沒吃飯，只能吃腐木中的蟲。有一次，他受傷躺在地上，黃喉貂以為他死了，把他當成獵物；沒想到，他反而設下陷阱抓住牠，靠牠充飢，才活了下來。至於被虎頭蜂追，更是家常便飯。","n":191,"ssz":"....................1......................................2..................................................................................................................................."},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"yehu3","idx":10,"text":"有人問阿介：「植物獵人這份工作，賺錢不多，又辛苦又危險，為什麼還要繼續下去？」阿介回答：「有些事情還是必須要有人去做啊！」他最大的期望，就是讓瀕臨絕種的植物得到妥善照顧，在保種中心永續留存，甚至有朝一日能在野外成功復育。這也是他一次次走入危險山林的原因。","n":127,"ssz":"............................1.....................................................................1............................"},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"yehu3","idx":11,"text":"二十五年來，阿介一次次走進山林，總共採集了兩萬種植物。他完成許多植物學家難以獨自完成的野外採集，也成為多篇學術論文的作者之一。因為他的努力，許多珍稀植物有了被保存、研究與復育的機會，更多人也開始看見植物保育的重要。","n":107,"ssz":".......................1........................................1.........................................."},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"yehu3","idx":12,"text":"而山林帶給他的，還不只是這些成就。過去，他在學校和工作中屢受挫折，嘗盡人情冷暖，甚至覺得自己這輩子就是一個衰人，人生看不出有什麼意義。然而，默默累積的山林經驗和植物專業知識並沒有白費。如今，他對各種植物的名稱與特性倒背如流，也能和研究人員用專業語言溝通。這份專業為他贏得尊重，也讓他找回失去已久的自信。","n":151,"ssz":"........................1..................1....1...1...................1......1..................................1................1..................."},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"yehu3","idx":13,"text":"他曾說：「在社會中，我是個貧窮失敗的人。」但是，在森林裡，他不只保存了植物，也找回了自己，走出一條真正屬於自己的路。","n":58,"ssz":"............1............................................."},{"section":"served:series","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"一般","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:title","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"植物獵人","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:genre","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"記敘文","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:reading_strategy","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"自我提問策略2──跟著人物故事線問問題","n":19,"ssz":"..................."},{"section":"served:reading_strategy_explained","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這一課我們要練習的是「問對重要的問題」，這能幫助你更深入理解故事，找出關鍵訊息，像是阿介為什麼能成為植物學家們的好幫手，以及他在艱辛採集過程中，是如何保持那份堅持的\n讀的時候，你可以試著問自己：「阿介是怎麼克服學歷限制的呢」「遇到危險時，他為什麼還能繼續下去」這些問題，你會發現故事裡很多值得你學習的地方","n":152,"ssz":".1..........................................1...........................................................................1........................1......"},{"section":"served:reading_strategy_explained#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這一課我們要練習的是「問對重要的問題」，這能幫助你更深入理解故事，找出關鍵訊息，像是阿介為什麼能成為植物學家們的好幫手，以及他在艱辛採集過程中，是如何保持那份堅持的","n":82,"ssz":".1..........................................1....................................."},{"section":"served:reading_strategy_explained#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"讀的時候，你可以試著問自己：「阿介是怎麼克服學歷限制的呢」「遇到危險時，他為什麼還能繼續下去」這些問題，你會發現故事裡很多值得你學習的地方","n":69,"ssz":".....................................1........................1......"},{"section":"served:intro.background","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這篇文章介紹了臺灣一位特別的「植物獵人」阿介。他雖然學歷不高，卻憑藉著對植物的熱愛和豐富的山林經驗，成為植物學家們倚重的夥伴。文章描述了植物獵人在保育瀕危物種、維持生態多樣性方面的重要角色，以及他們在野外採集時所面臨的艱辛與危險。同時，也呈現了阿介如何克服學歷限制，堅持夢想，並在工作中找回自信與人生價值的故事。","n":156,"ssz":".........1..................................................................................1..............................................................."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[0].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"一","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[0].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"閱讀聚光燈-自我提問策略2──跟著人物故事線問問題","n":25,"ssz":"........................."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[1].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"二","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[1].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"文章重點表","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[2].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"三","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[2].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"語詞我最棒","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[3].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"四","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[3].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"語詞應用","n":4,"ssz":"..1."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[4].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"五","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[4].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"閱讀理解","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[5].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"六","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[5].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"詞語複習","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[6].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"七","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[6].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"知識補給站","n":5,"ssz":"...1."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[0].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"奠定","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[0].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"建立穩固的基礎。","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:vocabulary[1].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"永續","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[1].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"能長久維持下去。","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:vocabulary[2].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"瀕臨","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[2].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"接近、快要面臨。本文「瀕臨滅絕」是指快要滅絕。","n":23,"ssz":"......................."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[3].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"樹冠","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[3].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"樹木上方長著許多樹枝和葉子的部分。","n":17,"ssz":"..........1.1..1."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[4].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"汲取","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[4].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"吸收、取得。常用來指學到知識或經驗。","n":18,"ssz":".................."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[5].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"倚重","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[5].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"信任並重視，常把重要工作交給他。","n":16,"ssz":"................"},{"section":"served:vocabulary[6].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"變遷","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[6].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"隨著時間產生的變化。","n":10,"ssz":".........."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[7].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"杳無人煙","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[7].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"形容地方偏僻荒涼，幾乎看不到人。","n":16,"ssz":".........1..1..."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[8].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"佼佼者","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[8].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"在一群人中特別優秀、出眾的人。","n":15,"ssz":"..............."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[9].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"僥倖","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[9].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"靠運氣意外成功或逃過危險。","n":13,"ssz":"............."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[10].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"棲地","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[10].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"生物居住、覓食和繁殖的地方。","n":14,"ssz":".......1......"},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[0].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這場車禍十分嚴重，只有他（　）逃過一劫。","n":20,"ssz":".................2.."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[1].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"她常閱讀科普書，不斷(　)新知。","n":16,"ssz":"........1......."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[2].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這座森林是石虎重要的 (　)，需要大家一起保護。","n":24,"ssz":"...................2...."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[3].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"經過多年努力，他已成為這個領域的(　)。","n":20,"ssz":"............1......."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[4].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"良好的閱讀習慣，能為日後學習(　)基礎。","n":20,"ssz":"...................."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[5].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"受到氣候(　)影響，許多動植物的生活環境正在改變。","n":25,"ssz":"........................."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[6].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這種動物數量快速減少，已經(　)滅絕。","n":19,"ssz":"..................."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[7].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"校長十分(　)這位經驗豐富的老師，常請他協助重要計畫。","n":27,"ssz":".1........................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"請問哪一個句子使用語詞有誤？","n":14,"ssz":"....1.1......."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這位研究員經驗豐富，深受團隊「倚重」","n":18,"ssz":".................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"森林被開發後，許多動物失去了原有的「棲地」","n":21,"ssz":"....................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這座夜市人潮擁擠，真是「杳無人煙」","n":17,"ssz":"................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"她從閱讀和旅行中不斷「汲取」新的經驗","n":18,"ssz":"....1...1........."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"根據文章，「植物獵人」最主要的工作是什麼？","n":21,"ssz":"....................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"在保種中心照顧已保存的植物","n":13,"ssz":"............."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"在農田中替植物防治病蟲害","n":12,"ssz":"............"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"在實驗室中分析植物生長資料","n":13,"ssz":"..........1.."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"進入野外辨認並採集稀有植物","n":13,"ssz":"............."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"本文第6段，阿介如何跨過學歷門檻，進入保種中心？","n":24,"ssz":"........................"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"持續自學，請專家替他推薦","n":12,"ssz":"............"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"重返校園，考上園藝科就讀","n":12,"ssz":"1..........."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"累積經驗，說服中心取消限制","n":13,"ssz":"1....1......."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"參加採集，先證明自己的能力","n":13,"ssz":"............."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"洪信介說：「有些事情還是必須要有人去做啊！」請問這件事指的是什麼？","n":33,"ssz":"................................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"積極投入種樹的行列","n":9,"ssz":"....1..1."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"保育瀕危絕種的植物","n":9,"ssz":"........."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"建造瀕危植物的庇護所","n":10,"ssz":".........."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"考上員林農工園藝科","n":9,"ssz":"........."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"下列哪一項最能概括阿介的人生轉變？","n":17,"ssz":"...1............."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他靠過人的膽識克服危險，最後取代植物學家完成研究","n":24,"ssz":"........................"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他不在意學歷門檻，只憑興趣就順利進入保種中心","n":22,"ssz":".1.........1.........."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他長期累積植物專業、跨越阻礙，也在保育工作中找到價值","n":26,"ssz":"...1......................"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他為了受到世界注目，才願意持續從事危險的採集工作","n":24,"ssz":".1......................"},{"section":"served:text_type","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"單","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.answer_carrier","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"紅色 ☑（w:sym Wingdings F0FE，在文字層但非 ☑ 字元）","n":38,"ssz":"......................................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"上一課，我們學會：讀人物故事時，先看故事發展到哪裡，再選一個適合的問題，帶著問題讀下一部分：\n①他想做什麼？為什麼想做？\n②他遇到什麼困難？怎麼繼續下去？\n③最後有什麼成果？帶來哪些改變？\n讀完後，再檢查：我能回答問題，也找得到課文線索嗎？回答不完整，就回頭找線索。\n這一課，我們用同樣的方法讀阿介的故事。","n":153,"ssz":".1...........................1..............1.........1................................................................................1................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"上一課，我們學會：讀人物故事時，先看故事發展到哪裡，再選一個適合的問題，帶著問題讀下一部分：","n":46,"ssz":".1...........................1..............1."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"①他想做什麼？為什麼想做？","n":13,"ssz":".......1....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"②他遇到什麼困難？怎麼繼續下去？","n":16,"ssz":"................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"③最後有什麼成果？帶來哪些改變？","n":16,"ssz":"................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"讀完後，再檢查：我能回答問題，也找得到課文線索嗎？回答不完整，就回頭找線索。","n":38,"ssz":"......................................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這一課，我們用同樣的方法讀阿介的故事。","n":19,"ssz":".1................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"先問，再讀：閱讀比較有方向","n":13,"ssz":"............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"【停點A】閱讀全文前\n自我提問\n❶先問，再讀","n":22,"ssz":"......................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"【停點A】閱讀全文前","n":10,"ssz":".........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"自我提問","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❶先問，再讀","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.看到標題，知道這是一篇人物故事。故事一開始，最適合帶著哪個問題讀？","n":35,"ssz":"....................2.........1...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他想做什麼？為什麼想做？","n":12,"ssz":"......1....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他遇到什麼困難？怎麼繼續下去？","n":15,"ssz":"..............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].options.3","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"最後有什麼成果？帶來哪些改變？","n":15,"ssz":"..............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❶先問，再讀\n2.帶著問題讀\n讀到【停點B】，把能回答上一題選項(如：想做什麼、「為什麼)的句子畫線。","n":51,"ssz":"............................2............1.....1..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"2.帶著問題讀","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"讀到【停點B】，把能回答上一題選項(如：想做什麼、「為什麼)的句子畫線。","n":36,"ssz":".............2............1.....1..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].note","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"「(如：想做什麼、「為什麼)」的引號與括號在原稿就不對稱，照抄未補","n":33,"ssz":"..........1..............1......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[5].paragraphs[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"（段1）臺灣有個只有國中學歷的植物獵人，名叫洪信介，大家都稱他為阿介。他是臺灣山林界的傳奇，也是許多博士、教授倚重的合作夥伴。","n":63,"ssz":".......1......................................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[5].paragraphs[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"（段2）但你知道嗎？阿介從小過動，不擅長與人相處，在課堂上總是坐不住，成績更是慘不忍睹，學習路上挫折不斷。長大後，他的工作也一直不穩定，四十四歲以前，只能靠打零工維生。所幸，他一直熱愛植物，也在大自然中找到了屬於自己的祕密花園。雖然在學校時課業不好，他卻沒有停止學習植物知識。植物圖鑑是他的精神糧食，遇到不懂的地方，他就請教專家，不斷汲取新知。日積月累，連拗口的植物學名也難不倒他。對植物的熱愛，讓他找到適合自己的學習方式，也奠定了日後成為植物獵人的基礎。","n":228,"ssz":".................1....1.........1.................1..1........2.........................2............................................................................1.........1..1........1........................................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[5].paragraphs[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"（段3）為什麼需要植物獵人呢？氣候變遷與人為開發不斷破壞棲地，使許多物種悄然從地球上消失。為了維持生態多樣性，科學家必須跟時間賽跑，趕在這些物種滅絕前，將它們保存下來，讓後世的科學家研究與復育。","n":97,"ssz":"....1...................1....................1..................................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[5].paragraphs[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"（段4）但是，要在原始森林裡採集植物並不容易。森林裡的植物分布位置有高有低，有些接近地面，有些位在高大的樹木上。位置越高，採集就越困難，樹冠層的植物尤其難以取得。採集者不只要會爬山、爬樹，還要能在無水無電、杳無人煙的森林裡求生；同時，也得辨識物種，判斷哪些植物稀有或具有研究價值。能爬山、爬樹、在野外求生的人其實不少，熟悉植物的人也有，但能同時具備山林能力與植物專業的人少之又少，阿介正是其中的佼佼者。他走在樹上就像走在平地一樣自然，又有專業的植物知識，能和科學家溝通。多年累積的山林經驗與植物知識，使他成為許多植物專家心目中的不二人選。","n":269,"ssz":"......................................................................................................................1.............................................................................................1...............1........1..........................1...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[5].paragraphs[4]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"（段5）2008年，辜嚴倬雲植物保種中心成立，需要植物獵人進行野外採集，以保存逐漸從野外消失，甚至瀕臨滅絕的物種。阿介很想進入保種中心，讓自己多年累積的山林經驗和植物專長，真正用在植物保育上。","n":96,"ssz":".........................................................................1......1..............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[6].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"【停點B】❶停一下，檢查理解","n":14,"ssz":".......1......"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[6].items[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"我找到答案。","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[6].items[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"我找到部分答案，要再回頭讀第2～5段找線索。","n":22,"ssz":"....1................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[6].answer_carrier","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"學生自填，原稿兩格都是空的 □","n":15,"ssz":"..............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[7].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❷先問，再讀\n知道阿介想做什麼了，接下來最適合帶著哪個問題讀？","n":31,"ssz":"..........................1...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[7].prompt#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❷先問，再讀","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[7].prompt#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"知道阿介想做什麼了，接下來最適合帶著哪個問題讀？","n":24,"ssz":"...................1...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❸帶著問題\n讀到【停點C】，把阿介遇到的困難和他採取的行動畫線。","n":32,"ssz":"......................1........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❸帶著問題","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"讀到【停點C】，把阿介遇到的困難和他採取的行動畫線。","n":26,"ssz":"................1........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].paragraphs[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"（段6）然而，保種中心卻因為他只有國中學歷，多次拒絕他。","n":28,"ssz":".............1.............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].paragraphs[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"（段7）阿介沒有就此放棄。為了跨過學歷這道門檻，中年的他決定重返校園，考上員林農工園藝科。這一次，他成為全班最認真的學生。對自己喜歡、擅長的事，他有一種「要做就做到最好」的執著。最後，他終於以學生身分進入保種中心，讓多年累積的能力有了發揮的機會。","n":123,"ssz":".............1................1...........................................2............4...........1..........1............"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[10].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"【停點C】❶停一下，檢查理解","n":14,"ssz":".......1......"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[10].items[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"我能回答問題。","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[10].items[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"我只能回答一部分，要再回頭讀第6段找線索。","n":21,"ssz":".......1............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[11].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❷同一個問題，繼續讀\n段8說他的困難還沒結束。\n請繼續帶著剛才的第②個問題，讀到【停點D】。把工作的困難，以及阿介仍持續採集的行動和原因畫線。","n":71,"ssz":"...1.............................................................1....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[11].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❷同一個問題，繼續讀","n":10,"ssz":"...1......"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[11].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"段8說他的困難還沒結束。","n":12,"ssz":"............"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[11].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"請繼續帶著剛才的第②個問題，讀到【停點D】。把工作的困難，以及阿介仍持續採集的行動和原因畫線。","n":47,"ssz":".........................................1....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[12].paragraphs[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"（段8）進入保種中心後，他面對的困難並沒有結束。阿介每年將近三分之一的時間待在森林裡。為了採集稀有植物，他常帶著一把鐮刀，揹著四十公斤重的背包，獨自徒步進入山林十幾天。他要沿途砍路、辨認與採集植物、進行現場測量，並完整記錄數據。在茂密的山林中，他還必須快速掃視四周，認出稀有且瀕危的植物。","n":144,"ssz":"...........................................1............2............1..................................1......................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[12].paragraphs[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"（段9）有人說，阿介從事的是全臺灣最危險的工作。為了採集植物，即使面對近乎垂直的峭壁，他也要冒著生命危險，想盡辦法爬上去。他曾一腳踩在枯枝上，從二十公尺高的樹上摔下；也曾在山林裡迷路，「在山上哭了三天」，才僥倖存活。他曾經兩天沒吃飯，只能吃腐木中的蟲。有一次，他受傷躺在地上，黃喉貂以為他死了，把他當成獵物；沒想到，他反而設下陷阱抓住牠，靠牠充飢，才活了下來。至於被虎頭蜂追，更是家常便飯。","n":195,"ssz":"........................1......................................2..................................................................................................................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[12].paragraphs[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"（段10）有人問阿介：「植物獵人這份工作，賺錢不多，又辛苦又危險，為什麼還要繼續下去？」阿介回答：「有些事情還是必須要有人去做啊！」他最大的期望，就是讓瀕臨絕種的植物得到妥善照顧，在保種中心永續留存，甚至有朝一日能在野外成功復育。這也是他一次次走入危險山林的原因。","n":132,"ssz":".................................1.....................................................................1............................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[13].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"【停點D】❶停一下，檢查理解","n":14,"ssz":".......1......"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[14].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.阿介遇到的困難？","n":10,"ssz":".........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[14].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"工作辛苦又危險","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[14].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"缺乏植物知識","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[15].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"2.他怎麼繼續？","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[15].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"等危險消失，再進山採集","n":11,"ssz":"..........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[15].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"靠專業與保育使命，繼續進山採集","n":15,"ssz":"..............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[16].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"3.理解情況","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[16].items[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"兩個問題都能回答","n":8,"ssz":".1......"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[16].items[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"我只找到部分答案，要再回頭讀第8～9段找線索。","n":23,"ssz":".....1................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[17].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❷先問，再讀\n知道阿介遇到的困難，以及他怎麼繼續下去。\n接下來最適合帶著哪個問題讀？","n":42,"ssz":".....................................1...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[17].prompt#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"知道阿介遇到的困難，以及他怎麼繼續下去。","n":20,"ssz":"...................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[17].prompt#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"接下來最適合帶著哪個問題讀？","n":14,"ssz":".........1...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[18].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❸帶著問題\n讀到【停點E】，把找到的答案畫線。","n":23,"ssz":"......................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[18].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"讀到【停點E】，把找到的答案畫線。","n":17,"ssz":"................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[19].paragraphs[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"（段10）二十五年來，阿介一次次走進山林，總共採集了兩萬種植物。他完成許多植物學家難以獨自完成的野外採集，也成為多篇學術論文的作者之一。因為他的努力，許多珍稀植物有了被保存、研究與復育的機會，更多人也開始看見植物保育的重要。","n":112,"ssz":"............................1........................................1.........................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[19].paragraphs[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"（段11）而山林帶給他的，還不只是這些成就。過去，他在學校和工作中屢受挫折，嘗盡人情冷暖，甚至覺得自己這輩子就是一個衰人，人生看不出有什麼意義。然而，默默累積的山林經驗和植物專業知識並沒有白費。如今，他對各種植物的名稱與特性倒背如流，也能和研究人員用專業語言溝通。這份專業為他贏得尊重，也讓他找回失去已久的自信。","n":156,"ssz":".............................1..................1....1...1...................1......1..................................1................1..................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[19].paragraphs[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"（段12）他曾說：「在社會中，我是個貧窮失敗的人。」但是，在森林裡，他不只保存了植物，也找回了自己，走出一條真正屬於自己的路。","n":63,"ssz":".................1............................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[20].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"【停點E】❶停一下，檢查理解","n":14,"ssz":".......1......"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[20].items[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"兩個角度都能回答。","n":9,"ssz":".1......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[20].items[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"我只找到一部分，要再回頭讀第10～12段。","n":21,"ssz":"......1.............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[21].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"◎自我檢核","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[21].items[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.我會跟著人物故事的發展，選出適合的問題，帶著問題讀。","n":28,"ssz":"............................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[21].items[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"2.我會檢查答案是否完整；不完整時，回頭找線索。","n":24,"ssz":"........................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[21].items[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"3.下次讀人物故事時，我會再用這三個問題，讓閱讀更有方向。","n":29,"ssz":".................1..........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[21].answer_carrier","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"學生自填，原稿三格都是空的 □","n":15,"ssz":"..............."},{"section":"served:keypoints.left_header","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"人物故事線","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:keypoints.right_header","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"文章重點","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:keypoints.instruction","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"帶著問題讀，你已經根據人物故事線，找到重點了，接著我們進一步整理出重點嘍！","n":37,"ssz":"............................1........"},{"section":"served:keypoints.answer_carrier","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"橘色手寫字（PDF p5）；文字層的【　】內已填有同樣的答案","n":30,"ssz":".............................."},{"section":"served:keypoints.rows[0].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"主角","n":2,"ssz":".1"},{"section":"served:keypoints.rows[0].value","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.洪信介，大家稱他為阿介，是臺灣山林界的【　】\n2.他熱愛植物，透過【　】和請教【　】的方式持續學習，累積山林經驗與植物知識。","n":64,"ssz":"......................................1.............1..........."},{"section":"served:keypoints.rows[0].value#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.洪信介，大家稱他為阿介，是臺灣山林界的【　】","n":24,"ssz":"........................"},{"section":"served:keypoints.rows[0].value#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"2.他熱愛植物，透過【　】和請教【　】的方式持續學習，累積山林經驗與植物知識。","n":39,"ssz":".............1.............1..........."},{"section":"served:keypoints.rows[0].blanks[0].answer","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"傳奇植物獵人","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":"served:keypoints.rows[0].blanks[1].answer","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"閱讀植物圖鑑","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":